Troubleshooting Tips
Python script issues:

If import errors occur, ensure Python 3 is installed: python3 --version
For permission errors with /tmp/users.txt, check file permissions: ls -l /tmp/users.txt
Bash script issues:

If "command not found" appears, verify script is executable: ls -l backup_script_fixed.sh
For ShellCheck not found: sudo apt install shellcheck
General debugging:

Add set -x at the start of bash scripts to see command execution
Use python3 -m pdb script.py for Python debugging
Check system logs: journalctl -xe or dmesg
